	(descr "Radial polarised capacitor D10 x L15 (JIERR PA series 10X10-21 row: D10.5 max, L+1 max, F 5.0, d 0.6) mounted UPRIGHT with SMD formed leads: leads trimmed and bent 90 deg outward into ~1.5 mm flat feet lapped onto 2.5 x 1.3 pads; no holes (nothing reaches the opposite board face). Pad 1 = +. Courtyard/fab sized for D10.5 max; model is the nominal part D10.0 x L15.0 (code 10X15) on a 1.0 assumed forming standoff; max D10.5 x L16.0.")
